1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=FAQ Q1] Question: Are tenant farmers eligible to get benefits of PM-KISAN? Answer: No, tenant farmers are not eligible. Only landholder farmer families who own cultivable land in their own names as per State land revenue records are eligible.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 724 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=FAQ Q2] Question: What is the mandatory requirement for receiving PM-KISAN instalments? Answer: eKYC is 100 percent mandatory for all registered PM-KISAN farmers. Additionally, bank accounts must be seeded with Aadhaar and mapped with NPCI.) Tj
